        "title": "Inspect Handoff's public graph representation",
        "research": "Identify the strongest machine-readable Handoff surface available: exported files, share/publish payloads, public API calls, DOM data, network responses, or documented graph schema. Capture one small specimen with several nodes, at least two relationship types, and any nested/grouped structure.",
