      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "Build one specimen conversion",
        "nextStep": "Choose one small public Handoff graph, capture its machine-readable representation, document the mapping from Handoff concepts to Twilite concepts, and generate a Twilite graph that can be opened beside the original for comparison.",
        "expectedEvidence": "A successful specimen should preserve recognizable topology and semantics while also behaving as a normal Twilite graph with native focus, semantic zoom, navigation, editing, and multigraph placement.",
